  "title": "Custom Packaging Boxes: Design your Own with PackMojo | PackMojo PackMojo",
  "content": "Custom boxes & packaging for brands of all sizes\nHassle-free solutions that make it easy to transform the unboxing experience.\nLow Minimums\nStart with as few as 100 units. Perfect for testing new packaging concepts or seasonal campaigns without overcommitting.\nFully Customizable\nFrom simple logo prints to intricate patterns inside and out. Every detail of your packaging is yours to design.\nSustainable by Default\nFSC-certified materials, recycled content, and soy-based inks. Premium packaging that respects the planet.\nExpert Guidance\nTailored recommendations from packaging specialists who understand your products and brand vision.\nHow it works\nThree simple steps from idea to finished product.\nChoose & Customize\nBrowse 40+ packaging types. Pick your box style and customize dimensions, materials, printing, and finishing.\nSample & Approve\nReceive a physical sample of your custom packaging. Make refinements until it's perfect.\nProduce & Deliver\nWe handle production, quality checks, and worldwide shipping. Ready in 12–16 business days (plus shipping).\nWho We Serve\nFor growing brands & enterprises\nRobust solutions and dedicated support that scale with your growth.\nQuality assurance\nFrom designers and prepress technicians, to operators and quality control inspectors, all parties work in harmony and follow stringent quality control processes to produce high-quality products in every production run.\nPackaging engineering\nOur team of engineers can help you develop custom packaging structures that optimize material and space, while providing the protection and security your products need in transit.\nScalability & reliability\nWhether you need 500 or 500,000 units produced, our production capacity can scale limitlessly to meet your operational demands.\nDedicated account manager\nGet priority support, one-on-one expert guidance, and ongoing consulting for current and future business needs.\nPopular custom boxes & printed packaging solutions\nThe Platform\nYour entire packaging workflow, streamlined\nNo more back-and-forth emails and confusing spreadsheets. The PackMojo platform gives you complete control from quote to delivery.\nConfigure your packaging\nChoose from 40+ product types. Customize size, materials, print, and finishes to match your brand perfectly.\nGet instant quotes & samples\nCompare multi-quantity quotes side by side. Order reimbursable samples to validate your design before production.\nFlexible shipping options\nAir or ocean freight, split shipments, multiple destinations. Choose the logistics that work for your timeline and budget.\nTrack everything in one place\nDownload dielines, upload artwork, track production progress, and manage reorders - all from your dashboard.\nEco-friendly packaging solutions\nWe're committed to offsetting our world's carbon footprint, contributing to reforestation, and sustainability. Not only do we offer packaging that's FSC™ certified, all of our premium product boxes is made from recycled materials and printed with soy-based ink.",
